{"id": "DF01", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，入职满1年的员工年假为5天 [1]。", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1828, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF02", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，事假需提前2天向直属主管申请。[1]", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1730, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF03", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，病假返岗后需在3个工作日内补交医院诊断证明或医嘱 [1]。", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1552, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF04", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，加班可选择申请调休，调休额度须在当季度内使用完毕 [1]。", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1430, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF05", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，公司每年为每位员工提供不低于 20 小时内部培训课程，覆盖制度、技能与团队协作。[1]", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1548, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF06", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，出差产生的交通和住宿费用报销标准如下：\n\n- **交通费**：实报实销，凭发票报销。出租车凭行程单实报实销，单日上限 200 元；高铁二等座、飞机经济舱（提前 7 天订票可享折扣价）；自驾按每公里 0.8 元补贴，需附里程记录 [1][2]。\n- **住宿费**：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）500 元/晚，其他城市 350 元/晚，凭发票实报实销，超出部分自理 [1][2]。\n\n报销流程为：出差结束后 3 个工作日内，在 OA 系统填写报销单并上传发票，经部门负责人审批、财务审核合规性后，5 个工作日内打款至工资卡 [1]。若发票丢失，需补开或出具情况说明，经部门负责人签字 [1]。\n\n引用来源：[1][2]", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2604, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF07", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，办公设备（如电脑、打印机）故障需通过邮件 it-support@company.com 提交工单，并注明设备编号 [1]。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1574, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF08", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，办公区打印机为无线打印，员工持工牌在打印终端刷卡取件；在浏览器上传文件即可发起打印 [1]。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1578, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF09", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，员工离职后 VPN 账号即时回收 [1]。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1191, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF10", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，新员工入职当天，IT 会自动开通：企业邮箱、内部 VPN、IAM 账号 [1]。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1255, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF11", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，LightCube 3.0 数据中台的默认网关并发为 500 请求/秒，且可按需水平扩容 [1]。", "sources": ["产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1506, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
