{"id": "DC07", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，出租车费用凭行程单实报实销，单日上限 200 元 [1][2]。报销时需在 OA 系统填写报销单并上传发票（行程单），经部门负责人审批和财务审核后打款至工资卡 [1]。若发票丢失，需补开或出具情况说明并经部门负责人签字 [1]。\n\n引用：\n[1] 报销制度（Demo 知识库：docs 库）\n[2] 差旅政策（Demo 知识库：docs 库）", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1771, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC08", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，交通费报销标准为实报实销，需凭发票报销 [1]。此外，打车费凭行程单实报实销，单日上限 200 元 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1334, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC09", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，发票丢失需补开或出具情况说明，经部门负责人签字后处理 [1]。  \n回答末尾引用来源：[1]", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1302, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC10", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，报销被驳回的常见原因包括：发票抬头错误、超出标准、缺少明细 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1172, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC11", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，紧急报销可联系财务加急，1 个工作日内处理 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1380, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC12", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，电子发票支持 PDF 与截图上传 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1439, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF14", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，入职满1年的员工可享受年假5天 [1]。但知识库中未明确说明该年假是否为带薪假，也未提及带薪假的其他类型（如病假、事假等）的具体天数。如需确认带薪假的具体范围，建议咨询人事部门或查阅相关制度文件。\n\n引用：\n[1] 员工手册（Demo 知识库）", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1956, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF15", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，年假最高累计 20 天 [1]。因此，年假攒着不花，最多能攒 20 天。\n\n引用：\n[1] 员工手册（Demo 知识库）", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1213, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF16", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的规定，请病假需在返岗后 3 个工作日内补交医院诊断证明或医嘱 [1]。", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1283, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF17", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，电脑、打印机等办公设备故障需通过邮件 it-support@company.com 提交工单，并注明设备编号。IT 响应时效为工作日 1 小时内响应。[1]", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1299, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF18", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，密码重置需在 IAM 系统自助完成，重置后 24 小时内生效 [1]。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1062, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF19", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，出差结束后需在 **3 个工作日内** 提交出差总结 [1]。  \n引用来源：[1] 差旅政策（Demo 知识库：docs 库）", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1671, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF20", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，LightCube 3.0 数据中台兼容的数据源支持 19 种，包括 MySQL、PostgreSQL、Kafka、SQL Server、Oracle、Hive、Redis、MongoDB、Elasticsearch 等 [1]。", "sources": ["产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1458, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF21", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，报销单需在OA系统中填写并上传发票 [1]。具体流程为：员工在OA填写报销单并上传发票，然后由部门负责人审批，财务审核后打款至工资卡 [1]。知识库中未提及除OA系统外的其他填报入口 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1499, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC13", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，杭州属于一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州），餐饮补贴标准为 150 元/天 [1]。若与客户用餐，需提前报备，凭发票实报实销 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1625, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC14", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，飞机票需提前 7 天订票可享折扣价 [1]。  \n引用：[1]", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1579, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC15", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，出差住宿费标准为：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）500元/晚，其他城市350元/晚，需凭发票实报实销，超出部分自理 [1][2]。具体金额取决于出差城市类别。\n\n如需更精确信息，请提供具体城市名称。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1572, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC16", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的报销制度，培训费每年有2000元额度，适用于部门内培训 [1]。  \n知识库中未找到其他关于培训费报销额度的相关依据。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 1, "elapsed_ms": 3255, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC17", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，出差期间周六日不计加班 [1]；法定节假日出差按加班计算 [1]。因此，出差赶上周末干活不算加班，但如果是法定节假日出差则按加班计算。\n\n引用：[1]", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1324, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC18", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "出差结束后 3 个工作日内于 OA 系统提交发票 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1000, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC19", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，普通费用报销在财务审核通过后，5 个工作日内打款至员工工资卡 [1]。紧急报销可联系财务加急，1 个工作日内处理 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1252, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF22", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，入职满1年的员工年假为5天 [1]。申请年假需提前3个工作日通过OA系统提交，经部门负责人审批后生效 [1]。", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1464, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF23", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的信息，普通费用报销在财务审核通过后，5个工作日内打款至员工工资卡 [1]。紧急报销可联系财务加急，1个工作日内处理 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1227, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": false, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF24", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "电脑、打印机等办公设备故障，可通过邮件 it-support@company.com 提交工单，并注明设备编号 [1]。IT 响应时效为工作日 1 小时内 [1]。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1238, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF25", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，连续输错 5 次密码将被锁号，需联系 IT 部门解锁 [1]。知识库中未提供具体解锁流程或联系方式，建议通过邮件 it-support@company.com 提交工单处理 [1]。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1387, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF26", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，出差餐饮补贴标准如下：\n\n- 一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）：150 元/天。\n- 其他城市：100 元/天。\n- 与客户用餐：需提前报备，凭发票实报实销。\n\n来源：[1]（差旅政策-餐饮补贴）、[2]（报销制度-餐饮费标准）", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1702, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": false, "hit5": false, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": "检索未命中: 期望['员工手册.md'] 实际['差旅政策.md', '报销制度.md']"}, "detail": "检索未命中: 期望['员工手册.md'] 实际['差旅政策.md', '报销制度.md']"}
{"id": "DF27", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，办公区打印机为无线打印，您需要持工牌在打印终端刷卡取件；在浏览器上传文件即可发起打印。[1]", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1276, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC20", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，出差需提前 2 天在 OA 系统提交出差申请 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1521, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC21", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的差旅政策，高铁标准为二等座，未提及一等座可报销。因此，坐高铁不能坐一等座，需按二等座标准执行。[1]\n\n如需其他帮助，请告知。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1633, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC22", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的差旅政策，自驾补贴标准为每公里 0.8 元 [1]。  \n（注：0.8 元即 8 毛，但政策原文未使用“几毛”表述，故按原文数据回答。）  \n\n引用上下文编号：[1]", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1463, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC23", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，发票丢失需补开或出具情况说明，经部门负责人签字 [1]。同时，出差结束后需在3个工作日内于OA系统提交发票，若发票丢失，需按上述流程处理 [1]。此外，紧急情况可联系财务加急处理 [1]。\n\n引用：\n[1] 报销制度（Demo 知识库：docs 库）", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1896, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC24", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，与客户用餐的报销规定如下：需提前报备，凭发票实报实销 [1]。报销时需在OA系统填写报销单并上传发票，经部门负责人审批后由财务审核，最终打款至工资卡 [2]。请注意，发票需合规（如抬头正确、有明细），否则可能被驳回 [2]。\n\n引用：\n[1] 差旅政策-餐饮补贴\n[2] 报销制度-报销流程及常见问题", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1811, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC25", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "报销被驳回的常见原因包括：发票抬头错误、超出报销标准、缺少明细 [1]。您可以对照这些原因检查您的报销单，如有疑问可联系财务部门核实具体驳回原因 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1393, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC26", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的报销制度，报销标准表里一共有 **5 个费用类别**，分别是：交通费、住宿费、餐饮费、办公用品、培训费 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1148, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": false, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": "回答缺要点: ans=根据知识库中的报销制度，报销标准表里一共有 **5 个费用类别**，分别是：交通费、住宿费、餐饮费、办公用品、培训费 [1]。"}, "detail": "回答缺要点: ans=根据知识库中的报销制度，报销标准表里一共有 **5 个费用类别**，分别是：交通费、住宿费、餐饮费、办公用品、培训费 [1]。"}
{"id": "DC27", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的报销制度，交通费的标准为“实报实销”，需凭发票报销 [1]。此外，差旅政策中补充说明出租车费用凭行程单实报实销，单日上限为 200 元 [2]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1365, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC28", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的报销制度，住宿费标准为：一线城市 500 元/晚，其他城市 350 元/晚 [1]。差旅政策中也明确了一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）为 500 元/晚，其他城市为 350 元/晚 [2]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1696, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC29", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据报销制度，一线城市住宿标准为 500 元/晚，其他城市为 350 元/晚，因此一线城市比其他城市每晚贵 150 元 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1520, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC30", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，餐饮费标准明确标注为“出差期间”适用，因此仅限出差期间报销 [1]。平时餐饮费不在该标准范围内。\n\n引用来源：\n[1] 报销制度（Demo 知识库：docs 库）", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1433, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC31", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，办公用品单笔限额为500元以下，需附采购清单。[1]", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1050, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC32", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，培训费报销额度为每年 2000 元，用于部门内培训 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 945, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC33", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，差旅政策中的住宿标准分为两档：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）为500元/晚，其他城市为350元/晚 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1480, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC34", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据差旅政策，一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）的餐饮补贴为 150 元/天，住宿标准为 500 元/晚 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1583, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC35", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，差旅政策中打车费单日上限为 200 元，凭行程单实报实销 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1481, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC36", "type": "多文档", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容：\n\n- **出差住宿标准**：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）为 500 元/晚，其他城市为 350 元/晚，需凭发票实报实销，超出部分自理 [1][2]。\n- **报销打款时限**：普通费用报销在财务审核通过后 5 个工作日内打款至工资卡 [1]。\n\n以上信息分别来源于 [1]（报销制度）和 [2]（差旅政策）。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1709, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC37", "type": "多文档", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，高铁座位规定为二等座 [2]；电子发票支持 PDF 与截图上传 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1163, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC38", "type": "多文档", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容：\n\n- 自驾补贴标准为每公里 0.8 元，需附里程记录 [2]。\n- 办公用品报销限额为单笔 500 元以下，需附采购清单 [1]。\n\n引用：\n[1] 报销制度（Demo 知识库：docs 库）\n[2] 差旅政策（Demo 知识库：docs 库）", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1783, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
